ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja481:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:10.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:10.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja481:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja481:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja481:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja481:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja481:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja481:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja481:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja481:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja481:0.4": "8. Takkāriyajātaka ", "ja481:1.1": "“Ahameva dubbhāsitaṁ bhāsi bālo, ", "ja481:1.2": "Bhekovaraññe ahimavhāyamāno; ", "ja481:1.3": "Takkāriye sobbhamimaṁ patāmi, ", "ja481:1.4": "Na kireva sādhu ativelabhāṇī”. ", "ja481:2.1": "“Pappoti macco ativelabhāṇī, ", "ja481:2.2": "Bandhaṁ vadhaṁ sokapariddavañca; ", "ja481:2.3": "Attānameva garahāsi ettha, ", "ja481:2.4": "Ācera yaṁ taṁ nikhaṇanti sobbhe”. ", "ja481:3.1": "“Kimevahaṁ tuṇḍilamanupucchiṁ, ", "ja481:3.2": "Kareyya saṁ bhātaraṁ kāḷikāyaṁ; ", "ja481:3.3": "Naggovahaṁ vatthayugañca jīno, ", "ja481:3.4": "Ayampi attho bahutādisova”. ", "ja481:4.1": "“Yo yujjhamānānamayujjhamāno, ", "ja481:4.2": "Meṇḍantaraṁ accupatī kuliṅgo; ", "ja481:4.3": "So piṁsito meṇḍasirehi tattha, ", "ja481:4.4": "Ayampi attho bahutādisova. ", "ja481:5.1": "Caturo janā potthakamaggahesuṁ, ", "ja481:5.2": "Ekañca posaṁ anurakkhamānā; ", "ja481:5.3": "Sabbeva te bhinnasirā sayiṁsu, ", "ja481:5.4": "Ayampi attho bahutādisova. ", "ja481:6.1": "Ajā yathā veḷugumbasmiṁ baddhā, ", "ja481:6.2": "Avakkhipantī asimajjhagacchi; ", "ja481:6.3": "Teneva tassā galakāvakantaṁ, ", "ja481:6.4": "Ayampi attho bahutādisova”. ", "ja481:7.1": "“Ime na devā na gandhabbaputtā, ", "ja481:7.2": "Migā ime atthavasaṁ gatā me; ", "ja481:7.3": "Ekañca naṁ sāyamāse pacantu, ", "ja481:7.4": "Ekaṁ punappātarāse pacantu”. ", "ja481:8.1": "“Sataṁ sahassāni dubhāsitāni, ", "ja481:8.2": "Kalampi nāgghanti subhāsitassa; ", "ja481:8.3": "Dubbhāsitaṁ saṅkamāno kileso, ", "ja481:8.4": "Tasmā tuṇhī kimpurisā na bālyā”. ", "ja481:9.1": "“Yā mesā byāhāsi pamuñcathetaṁ, ", "ja481:9.2": "Giriñca naṁ himavantaṁ nayantu; ", "ja481:9.3": "Imañca kho dentu mahānasāya, ", "ja481:9.4": "Pātova naṁ pātarāse pacantu”. ", "ja481:10.1": "“Pajjunnanāthā pasavo, ", "ja481:10.2": "pasunāthā ayaṁ pajā; ", "ja481:10.3": "Tvaṁ nāthosi mahārāja, ", "ja481:10.4": "nāthohaṁ bhariyāya me; ", "ja481:10.5": "Dvinnamaññataraṁ ñatvā, ", "ja481:10.6": "mutto gaccheyya pabbataṁ. ", "ja481:11.1": "Na ve nindā suparivajjayetha, ", "ja481:11.2": "Nānā janā sevitabbā janinda; ", "ja481:11.3": "Yeneva eko labhate pasaṁsaṁ, ", "ja481:11.4": "Teneva añño labhate ninditāraṁ. ", "ja481:12.1": "Sabbo loko paricitto aticitto, ", "ja481:12.2": "Sabbo loko cittavā samhi citte; ", "ja481:12.3": "Paccekacittā puthu sabbasattā, ", "ja481:12.4": "Kassīdha cittassa vasena vatte”. ", "ja481:13.1": "“Tuṇhī ahū kimpuriso sabhariyo, ", "ja481:13.2": "Yo dāni byāhāsi bhayassa bhīto; ", "ja481:13.3": "So dāni mutto sukhito arogo, ", "ja481:13.4": "Vācākirevatthavatī narānan”ti. ", "ja481:14.1": "Takkāriyajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja481:0.1": "", "ja481:0.2": "", "ja481:0.3": "", "ja481:0.4": "", "ja481:1.1": "", "ja481:1.2": "ahimavhāyamāno → ahimavhayāno (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja481:1.3": "sobbhamimaṁ → sobbhamhi ahaṁ (mr) ", "ja481:1.4": "sādhu ativelabhāṇī → sādhūtyativelabhāṇī (mr) ", "ja481:2.1": "", "ja481:2.2": "", "ja481:2.3": "", "ja481:2.4": "", "ja481:3.1": "", "ja481:3.2": "Kareyya saṁ → kareyyāsaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); kareyya sa (mr); bhareyya saṁ (?) | kāḷikāyaṁ → kālikāya (sya1ed, sya2ed); kālikāyaṁ (pts-vp-pli1); kāḷikāya (mr) ", "ja481:3.3": "Naggovahaṁ → naggoca'haṁ (?) ", "ja481:3.4": "", "ja481:4.1": "yujjhamānānamayujjhamāno → yujjhamānānaṁ ayujjhamāno (sya1ed, sya2ed); yujjhamānena ayujjhamāno (mr) ", "ja481:4.2": "", "ja481:4.3": "", "ja481:4.4": "", "ja481:5.1": "", "ja481:5.2": "", "ja481:5.3": "", "ja481:5.4": "", "ja481:6.1": "baddhā → bandhā (sya1ed, sya2ed); bandhaṁ (mr) ", "ja481:6.2": "", "ja481:6.3": "galakāvakantaṁ → galakaṁ vikantā (sya1ed, sya2ed); galayā vikantuṁ (mr) ", "ja481:6.4": "", "ja481:7.1": "", "ja481:7.2": "atthavasaṁ gatā me → atthavasāhatā ime (bj); atthavasābhatā ime (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja481:7.3": "", "ja481:7.4": "Ekaṁ punappātarāse → ekañca puna pātarāse (bj); ekañca naṁ pātarāse (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja481:8.1": "", "ja481:8.2": "", "ja481:8.3": "kileso → kilissati (?) ", "ja481:8.4": "kimpurisā → kimpuriso (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja481:9.1": "byāhāsi → vyākāsi (bj); byākāsi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja481:9.2": "Giriñca naṁ → giriṁ varaṁ (mr) ", "ja481:9.3": "", "ja481:9.4": "", "ja481:10.1": "", "ja481:10.2": "", "ja481:10.3": "Tvaṁ nāthosi → tvaṁ-nātho'smi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja481:10.4": "nāthohaṁ bhariyāya me → amha-nāthā mama bhariyā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); nāthohaṁ bhariyāya ca (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja481:10.5": "", "ja481:10.6": "", "ja481:11.1": "suparivajjayetha → suparivajjayātha (sya1ed, sya2ed); suparivajjayā ce (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja481:11.2": "", "ja481:11.3": "", "ja481:11.4": "", "ja481:12.1": "paricitto aticitto → paracittena acitto (bj); paracittena aticitto (sya1ed, sya2ed); paracitto acitto (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja481:12.2": "", "ja481:12.3": "", "ja481:12.4": "", "ja481:13.1": "sabhariyo → abhāṇī (mr) ", "ja481:13.2": "", "ja481:13.3": "", "ja481:13.4": "", "ja481:14.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja481:0.1": "", "ja481:0.2": "", "ja481:0.3": "", "ja481:0.4": "", "ja481:1.1": "ms22J_2494, msdiv104, pts-vp-pli4.247, sya27.357", "ja481:1.2": "", "ja481:1.3": "", "ja481:1.4": "", "ja481:2.1": "dr27.356, ms22J_2495, msdiv105, pts-vp-pli4.248", "ja481:2.2": "", "ja481:2.3": "", "ja481:2.4": "", "ja481:3.1": "ms22J_2496, msdiv106, pts-vp-pli4.249", "ja481:3.2": "", "ja481:3.3": "", "ja481:3.4": "", "ja481:4.1": "csp1ed22.269, csp2ed22.269, ms22J_2497, msdiv107, ndp22.261, pts-vp-pli4.250", "ja481:4.2": "", "ja481:4.3": "", "ja481:4.4": "", "ja481:5.1": "ms22J_2498, msdiv108, pts-vp-pli4.251", "ja481:5.2": "", "ja481:5.3": "", "ja481:5.4": "", "ja481:6.1": "ms22J_2499, msdiv109, sya27.358", "ja481:6.2": "", "ja481:6.3": "", "ja481:6.4": "", "ja481:7.1": "bj30.466, dr27.357, ms22J_2500, msdiv110, pts-vp-pli4.252", "ja481:7.2": "", "ja481:7.3": "", "ja481:7.4": "", "ja481:8.1": "ms22J_2501, msdiv111", "ja481:8.2": "", "ja481:8.3": "", "ja481:8.4": "", "ja481:9.1": "ms22J_2502, msdiv112, pts-vp-pli4.253, vri68.208", "ja481:9.2": "", "ja481:9.3": "", "ja481:9.4": "", "ja481:10.1": "csp1ed22.270, csp2ed22.270, ms22J_2503, msdiv113, ndp22.262", "ja481:10.2": "", "ja481:10.3": "", "ja481:10.4": "", "ja481:10.5": "", "ja481:10.6": "", "ja481:11.1": "ms22J_2504, msdiv114, pts-vp-pli4.254, sya27.359", "ja481:11.2": "", "ja481:11.3": "", "ja481:11.4": "", "ja481:12.1": "dr27.358, ms22J_2505, msdiv115", "ja481:12.2": "", "ja481:12.3": "", "ja481:12.4": "", "ja481:13.1": "ms22J_2506, msdiv116", "ja481:13.2": "", "ja481:13.3": "", "ja481:13.4": "", "ja481:14.1": "ms22J_2507"}, "keys_order": ["ja481:0.1", "ja481:0.2", "ja481:0.3", "ja481:0.4", "ja481:1.1", "ja481:1.2", "ja481:1.3", "ja481:1.4", "ja481:2.1", "ja481:2.2", "ja481:2.3", "ja481:2.4", "ja481:3.1", "ja481:3.2", "ja481:3.3", "ja481